This is terrible table manners — well, I'm showing everyone a bad example right now.

278
00:23:18,030 --> 00:23:22,170
This is what you should NOT do, okay everyone?

279
00:23:22,170 --> 00:23:28,910
If you did this at a restaurant — actually, you shouldn't do this at home either. Got it?

280
00:23:29,250 --> 00:23:31,510
Got it?

281
00:23:31,510 --> 00:23:33,970
