467
00:44:51,640 --> 00:44:53,440
Oh no!

468
00:44:53,440 --> 00:45:00,470
No no no no no!

469
00:45:00,470 --> 00:45:06,920
It sinks into the floor when you hold it wrong.

470
00:45:06,920 --> 00:45:10,220
If you grip it the wrong way—

471
00:45:10,220 --> 00:45:13,110
It went in!

472
00:45:13,110 --> 00:45:21,130
Wait, did I just do something amazing?

473
00:45:21,130 --> 00:45:24,530
Nobody would want to drink this, right?

474
00:45:24,530 --> 00:45:26,810
I mean, come on.

475
00:45:27,770 --> 00:45:30,380
There's no way anyone's drinking that.

476
00:45:30,180 --> 00:45:31,980
Oh! Oh! Oh! Oh!

477
00:45:32,180 --> 00:45:34,180
Yes! Yes!

478
00:45:46,180 --> 00:45:48,180
Come on, come on, come on!

479
00:45:50,180 --> 00:45:53,180
Yes! I actually cleared it! I'm so happy!

480
00:45:53,180 --> 00:45:55,540
Where did the 3-second rule go?

481
00:45:55,340 --> 00:45:56,780
Anyway, setting that aside—

482
00:45:56,780 --> 00:45:58,740
it's been so dark this whole time!

483
00:45:58,740 --> 00:46:03,240
Is this a hot pot?

484
00:46:03,240 --> 00:46:04,980
Aren't there barely any ingredients?

485
00:46:11,200 --> 00:46:12,420
It's dark, dark, dark!

486
00:46:12,420 --> 00:46:19,160
How bright was it before?

487
00:46:20,860 --> 00:46:21,520
Everyone...

488
00:46:21,520 --> 00:46:24,340
This is all there is, huh.

489
00:46:24,340 --> 00:46:29,990
It's so dark.

490
00:46:29,990 --> 00:46:34,070
What is this, meat?

491
00:46:34,070 --> 00:46:38,900
Is this meat?

492
00:46:41,170 --> 00:46:43,870
The arrows look like elevator buttons.

493
00:46:43,870 --> 00:46:48,250
I can't grab it!

494
00:46:48,250 --> 00:46:53,420
Oh, it is meat.

495
00:46:53,420 --> 00:46:56,040
Stop squirming!

496
00:46:56,040 --> 00:46:58,420
You're already dead, you know.

497
00:46:58,420 --> 00:47:00,820
Be grateful for the ingredients.

498
00:47:00,820 --> 00:47:08,610
Two pieces, two pieces.

499
00:47:08,610 --> 00:47:18,480
This is already really hard.

500
00:47:40,190 --> 00:47:42,320
Nice, nice, nice!

501
00:47:42,300 --> 00:47:43,720
I'm doing it, I'm doing it!

502
00:47:43,720 --> 00:47:44,460
I'm actually doing it!

503
00:47:44,460 --> 00:47:46,260
Wait, what? Huh?

504
00:47:46,260 --> 00:47:50,960
Umm...

505
00:48:01,950 --> 00:48:03,750
Okay...

506
00:48:03,750 --> 00:48:05,750
Oh, I have to sort them onto separate plates?

507
00:48:09,550 --> 00:48:11,350
OK.

508
00:48:13,150 --> 00:48:14,950
What's this? Carrots?

509
00:48:14,950 --> 00:48:16,910
Mushrooms.

510
00:48:16,910 --> 00:48:18,950
Oh, maybe this is steak?

511
00:48:18,950 --> 00:48:22,130
Could be steak.

512
00:48:22,130 --> 00:48:24,650
But isn't this hard?

513
00:48:24,650 --> 00:48:32,140
Hey, why is the 3-second rule being so strict all of a sudden?

514
00:48:32,140 --> 00:48:35,260
Where did all that leniency from before go?

515
00:48:35,060 --> 00:48:40,760
Am I actually getting better?

516
00:48:50,600 --> 00:48:55,250
No! Hey!

517
00:48:55,250 --> 00:48:58,300
Hey hey hey hey hey!

518
00:48:58,300 --> 00:49:01,320
I'm better than I was before.

519
00:49:11,760 --> 00:49:16,080
I'm getting better, right?

520
00:49:16,080 --> 00:49:20,080
Though even if I get better at this game,

521
00:49:20,080 --> 00:49:23,880
it doesn't necessarily mean my real chopstick skills will improve.

522
00:49:25,680 --> 00:49:28,290
That might be a different story.

523
00:49:28,090 --> 00:49:31,780
Wait, now the 3-second rule is gone again?

524
00:49:45,320 --> 00:49:48,580
It's so dark...

525
00:49:48,580 --> 00:49:53,060
