526
00:49:52,860 --> 00:49:55,230
It flew off!

527
00:50:18,240 --> 00:50:27,790
Wait, so you put the same ingredient... oh, is that how it works?

528
00:50:28,980 --> 00:50:33,210
Hmm, let me try something real quick.

529
00:50:33,210 --> 00:50:36,010
So this means...

530
00:50:36,010 --> 00:50:40,350
Does it go to every plate? Oh wait, that doesn't even matter.

531
00:50:40,470 --> 00:50:44,670
These guys—

532
00:50:44,670 --> 00:50:52,550
just mushrooms on this one.

533
00:50:53,010 --> 00:50:59,110
Stop bouncing around, ingredients!

534
00:50:59,330 --> 00:51:03,160
Settle down, mountain vegetables!

535
00:51:03,480 --> 00:51:09,540
This thin straw-like thing — is this water spinach?

536
00:51:10,100 --> 00:51:15,540
Maybe?

537
00:51:15,840 --> 00:51:19,690
This is so hard!

538
00:51:20,210 --> 00:51:28,230
It's so lively — it's spinning like a Beyblade!

539
00:51:28,590 --> 00:51:38,120
Wow, this is surprisingly difficult!

540
00:51:38,340 --> 00:51:45,710
Woo!

541
00:51:46,090 --> 00:51:54,600
