544
00:52:20,230 --> 00:52:23,730
Oh, it's on — wait, no it's not.

545
00:52:24,070 --> 00:52:34,070
Stay there, stay there, you stay right there. You're staying there.

546
00:52:35,370 --> 00:52:44,130
Just stay put, okay?

547
00:52:44,650 --> 00:52:47,450
These thin vegetables are so hard to grab!

548
00:52:51,870 --> 00:52:54,870
