551
00:53:11,200 --> 00:53:14,000
Well, the main pillar here is...

552
00:53:17,600 --> 00:53:19,600
Oh right, I have to put that one back.

553
00:53:20,400 --> 00:53:21,400
OK.

554
00:53:22,200 --> 00:53:27,200
