555
00:53:28,110 --> 00:53:31,110
Well, leaves are just... what can you do.

556
00:53:31,910 --> 00:53:33,840
Ugh, I messed up!

557
00:53:33,840 --> 00:53:35,710
Ugh, I messed up again!

558
00:53:38,610 --> 00:53:42,610
