577
00:55:40,600 --> 00:55:42,600
Ooh, that fried egg looks good.

578
00:55:48,250 --> 00:55:50,150
Bacon!

579
00:55:59,390 --> 00:56:01,390
It's so dark, so dark, so dark!

580
00:56:04,440 --> 00:56:06,440
It's too dark!

581
00:56:17,500 --> 00:56:19,500
It's a little dark.

582
00:56:19,500 --> 00:56:22,460
