596
00:57:49,440 --> 00:57:52,440
Hey hey, from the start...

597
00:57:52,840 --> 00:58:00,390
This is ridiculous.

598
00:58:00,390 --> 00:58:03,360
Like this...

599
00:58:03,360 --> 00:58:12,580
Whoa, it's dancing!

600
00:58:12,580 --> 00:58:14,400
This is hard.

601
00:58:14,400 --> 00:58:17,650
Just two pieces.

602
00:58:26,920 --> 00:58:31,080
Easy!

603
00:58:31,080 --> 00:58:34,080
Look at me go!

604
00:58:35,160 --> 00:58:38,000
Triangular shapes are hard to carry though.

605
00:58:37,800 --> 00:58:41,050
Maybe I can do it.

606
00:59:02,640 --> 00:59:08,910
No cheating.

607
00:59:08,910 --> 00:59:12,430
No cheating.

608
00:59:12,430 --> 00:59:16,410
Sushi!

609
00:59:16,410 --> 00:59:23,370
Dip one or more pieces of sushi in soy sauce, it says.

610
00:59:27,170 --> 00:59:34,750
