611
00:59:34,750 --> 00:59:39,440
What does that even mean?

612
00:59:39,440 --> 00:59:44,480
Ugh, dipping it is so hard~

613
00:59:44,480 --> 00:59:46,280
Whoa whoa whoa whoa!

614
00:59:46,280 --> 00:59:48,740
Did it touch? Did it dip?

615
00:59:48,740 --> 00:59:54,220
Oh, I think it did!

616
00:59:54,020 --> 00:59:56,020
Ahh...

617
01:00:14,020 --> 01:00:15,850


618
01:00:16,540 --> 01:00:18,540
This, this...

619
01:00:18,330 --> 01:00:22,540
This is crazy, this is insane!

620
01:00:22,540 --> 01:00:24,540
Isn't it hard to hold it vertically like this?

621
01:00:54,340 --> 01:01:02,880


622
01:01:02,670 --> 01:01:06,670
