625
01:01:22,850 --> 01:01:23,850
Oh, that's good, that's good!

626
01:01:28,070 --> 01:01:29,070
That's good, that's good, that's good!

627
01:01:32,490 --> 01:01:37,030
Oh, sorry sorry sorry sorry sorry sorry sorry sorry sorry sorry! Sorry!

628
01:01:40,210 --> 01:01:43,450
This is the problem! Holding it vertically is so hard!

629
01:01:44,430 --> 01:01:54,430
So I go slowly like this, like this — isn't that fine? Isn't that fine?

630
01:02:06,960 --> 01:02:07,960
Okay, okay, okay...

631
01:02:45,610 --> 01:02:48,800
The sushi keeps disappearing... lol

632
01:02:49,350 --> 01:02:56,100
The sushi just keeps vanishing, why?

633
01:03:01,410 --> 01:03:05,210
Like this, li—

634
01:03:05,210 --> 01:03:08,090
Like this.

635
01:03:08,550 --> 01:03:13,850
This is so hard.

636
01:03:14,090 --> 01:03:17,040
Hmm...

637
01:03:17,200 --> 01:03:19,400
Ahh...

638
01:03:29,960 --> 01:03:36,680
Just a little bit.

639
01:03:37,440 --> 01:03:39,680
Together.

640
01:03:39,680 --> 01:03:41,680
Here we go.

641
01:03:43,680 --> 01:03:46,630
Okay, okay, this should be about right.

642
01:03:59,830 --> 01:04:01,070
Oh, nice!

643
01:04:00,870 --> 01:04:02,030


644
01:04:15,750 --> 01:04:18,500
Damn it.

645
01:04:18,300 --> 01:04:20,300
This is crazy, guys!

646
01:04:35,830 --> 01:04:40,030
So, um...

647
01:04:40,030 --> 01:04:43,890
Everything just disappears when I put it down!

648
01:04:43,890 --> 01:04:49,030
As soon as I set it on the table, it's gone!

649
01:04:49,030 --> 01:04:55,780
Maybe I can do it vertically?

650
01:05:02,410 --> 01:05:05,360
No, that's impossible.

651
01:05:20,850 --> 01:05:27,610
It's not a jungle gym!

652
01:05:27,610 --> 01:05:34,600
Just rice isn't sushi, you know.

653
01:05:34,600 --> 01:05:39,240
Maybe I should do it this way?

654
01:05:39,240 --> 01:05:43,850
I got it! This—

655
01:05:43,850 --> 01:05:45,410
Really?

656
01:05:47,750 --> 01:05:50,230
Maybe I have to slide it.

657
01:05:58,550 --> 01:05:59,410
Oh.

658
01:06:16,690 --> 01:06:18,350
So I do this—

659
01:06:37,210 --> 01:06:38,410
