660
01:06:48,910 --> 01:06:50,210
This is wrong, this is so wrong.

661
01:06:51,150 --> 01:06:52,150
This is just wrong!

662
01:06:51,950 --> 01:07:01,950
Ahahahaha— I keep touching it, what am I supposed to do?! There's no way to grab this!

663
01:07:19,260 --> 01:07:21,080
Into the soy sauce dish—

664
