667
01:08:18,090 --> 01:08:20,090
Oh, oh, that's it.

668
01:08:46,640 --> 01:08:48,290
About this much—

669
01:08:48,090 --> 01:08:50,090
If I move it this far...

670
01:09:03,090 --> 01:09:04,090
Oh?

671
01:09:06,590 --> 01:09:08,670
Oh?

672
01:09:08,470 --> 01:09:16,690
Is this working?

673
01:09:16,690 --> 01:09:20,290
Is this working?

674
01:09:28,080 --> 01:09:29,080
No good, it won't get on.

675
01:09:29,080 --> 01:09:30,080
Ahhh! It disappeared!

676
01:09:29,880 --> 01:09:31,880
It's gone! Damn it!

677
01:09:31,680 --> 01:09:35,630


678
01:10:01,680 --> 01:10:08,430
There's nothing I can do here, right?

679
