There's nothing I can do — this is truly "scattered sushi"!

680
01:10:15,190 --> 01:10:20,190
That's a good one.

681
01:10:28,790 --> 01:10:30,620
Okay.

682
01:10:30,420 --> 01:10:32,820
From here, everyone!

683
01:10:34,820 --> 01:10:36,820
There—

684
01:10:38,820 --> 01:10:40,820
Pop—

685
