688
01:11:30,880 --> 01:11:33,700
What the heck is going on?!

689
01:11:33,700 --> 01:11:36,480
There's still more of you guys!

690
01:11:48,340 --> 01:11:53,340
Well, it is a chopstick game, so maybe I should actually try using proper chopstick technique.

691
01:11:53,340 --> 01:11:56,140
It's hard though.

692
01:12:25,940 --> 01:12:29,890
What is even happening right now?

693
01:12:38,020 --> 01:12:41,090
Exploding sushi.

694
01:12:45,490 --> 01:12:47,490
Oh, oh, oh, something—

695
01:12:47,490 --> 01:12:50,290
This feels good, this feels good!

696
01:12:50,290 --> 01:13:00,020
Whoa, this is actually looking good!

697
01:13:00,020 --> 01:13:04,850
Oh, oh—

698
01:13:04,850 --> 01:13:06,650
Oh, oh, oh—

699
01:13:06,650 --> 01:13:09,380
Oh no, oh no, oh no!

700
01:13:09,380 --> 01:13:12,330
"Feeling good," she says.

701
01:13:22,580 --> 01:13:24,580
Damn it.

702
01:13:24,580 --> 01:13:27,900
What do I do?

703
01:13:27,900 --> 01:13:30,700
So like—

704
01:13:30,880 --> 01:13:34,600
Does the topping have to be properly on top of the rice

705
01:13:34,600 --> 01:13:37,920
