707
01:13:57,930 --> 01:13:59,930
Okay.

708
01:14:39,650 --> 01:14:41,970


709
01:15:04,770 --> 01:15:06,330
Hahaha— where are you all going?!

710
01:15:06,330 --> 01:15:16,170
Can you guys just be scattered for a sec?

711
01:15:38,210 --> 01:15:41,810
Wait, this is crazy!

712
01:15:41,810 --> 01:15:49,090
The topping has to be on the rice — it might not count otherwise!

713
01:15:49,090 --> 01:15:53,520
Really?

714
01:15:53,520 --> 01:16:01,460
No way!

715
01:16:01,460 --> 01:16:05,730
Or maybe it's that?

716
01:16:05,730 --> 01:16:08,280
It disappeared.

717
01:16:16,520 --> 01:16:18,440
Nice!

718
01:16:18,440 --> 01:16:19,680
Wait, why suddenly?

719
01:16:19,480 --> 01:16:22,480
Whoa, scary scary scary, it just happened, it just happened!

720
01:16:36,260 --> 01:16:38,280
Oh, this is tough.

721
01:17:15,380 --> 01:17:17,940
Wait, I might actually be able to do this.

722
01:17:19,480 --> 01:17:25,300
Why do you keep running away?

723
01:17:25,300 --> 01:17:26,920
Please...

724
01:17:26,920 --> 01:17:30,170
How did that even—

725
01:17:38,160 --> 01:17:40,800
Where did it go?

726
01:17:44,080 --> 01:17:45,420
But you know what,

727
01:17:45,420 --> 01:17:48,260
I'm realizing this might actually be doable.

728
01:17:59,280 --> 01:18:01,720
Wait, this is crazy though.

729
01:18:15,280 --> 01:18:17,380
Hey hey hey, I can do this!

730
01:18:32,590 --> 01:18:36,220
Almost... aww, so close!

731
01:18:49,480 --> 01:18:51,480
Thank you very much!

732
01:18:51,870 --> 01:18:56,170
Yes yes yes yes!

733
01:19:04,920 --> 01:19:07,920
Shrimp is not that hard, it's not that hard!

734
01:19:21,920 --> 01:19:23,920
Dang it!

735
01:19:38,920 --> 01:19:41,920
I dipped it, I dipped it!

736
01:19:56,110 --> 01:19:58,910
Nice! How am I suddenly so good at this?

737
01:19:58,910 --> 01:20:02,940
Scary scary!

738
01:20:03,940 --> 01:20:10,370
Yes! And on top of that!

739
01:20:10,370 --> 01:20:12,370
Whoa!

740
01:20:12,370 --> 01:20:14,170
Fried food, huh.

741
01:20:24,990 --> 01:20:25,940
OK.

742
01:20:25,940 --> 01:20:27,650
What is this? A hamburger patty?

743
01:20:27,650 --> 01:20:29,340
Karaage?

744
01:20:29,340 --> 01:20:30,540
Chicken nuggets?

745
01:20:35,170 --> 01:20:36,670
I mean, if you just keep trying, something's gotta work, right?

746
01:20:46,020 --> 01:20:47,720
It's a numbers game, isn't it?

747
01:20:52,290 --> 01:20:53,490
Maybe not though.

748
01:20:55,920 --> 01:20:57,620
Actually, this is surprisingly hard.

749
01:21:39,820 --> 01:21:41,020
This is hopeless.

750
01:21:41,620 --> 01:21:42,820
Yeah, this is not working.

751
01:21:43,620 --> 01:21:44,920
It just flies off on its own!

752
01:21:48,080 --> 01:21:50,580
I think getting closer is definitely the way to go here.

753
01:21:50,580 --> 01:21:51,480
Ugh, this is impossible.

754
01:21:51,480 --> 01:21:53,080
