760
01:22:49,510 --> 01:22:53,570
With this BGM, it's starting to look like they're dancing.

761
01:22:54,170 --> 01:22:55,890
The ingredients are dancing.

762
01:22:57,450 --> 01:23:00,250
Like, "become delicious, become delicious!"

763
01:23:00,910 --> 01:23:08,460
I want to cook it a bit more, color-wise.

764
01:23:08,460 --> 01:23:12,060
It went somewhere.

765
01:23:21,090 --> 01:23:22,540
Ahaha, come on!

766
01:23:22,340 --> 01:23:25,590
Ugh, seriously!

767
01:23:50,090 --> 01:23:51,310
Good evening!

768
01:23:51,310 --> 01:23:52,710
Good evening, woof woof!

769
01:23:52,500 --> 01:23:54,960
"Good evening, woof woof" is kinda cute, isn't it.

770
01:23:54,960 --> 01:23:58,580
Is "good evening, woof woof" too basic though?

771
01:23:58,580 --> 01:24:00,960
Good evening, woof woof!

772
01:24:04,120 --> 01:24:08,840
It's way too late to change my greeting now.

773
01:24:08,840 --> 01:24:16,860
But Tokyu Hands changed their logo,

774
01:24:16,860 --> 01:24:20,820
