778
01:24:57,370 --> 01:25:01,640
I don't know how I managed it, but

779
01:25:01,640 --> 01:25:02,900
I did it.

780
01:25:02,900 --> 01:25:08,250
This is even harder than the beans.

781
01:25:15,870 --> 01:25:19,750
In the hot pot, I can't see anything.

782
01:25:19,550 --> 01:25:21,550
At the edge of the pot,

783
01:25:49,550 --> 01:25:54,200
I just can't grab them.

784
01:26:10,090 --> 01:26:11,730
I can't grab them at all.

785
01:26:11,730 --> 01:26:18,130
