791
01:26:54,250 --> 01:26:57,250
A croquette? No, that's not a croquette.

792
01:27:01,020 --> 01:27:02,920
Whoa, I almost had it just now.

793
01:27:10,430 --> 01:27:12,430
How graceful.

794
01:27:23,980 --> 01:27:26,980
The arrows and exclamation marks are blocking everything, I can't see a thing.

795
01:27:31,990 --> 01:27:33,990
One of them just disappeared.

796
01:27:34,870 --> 01:27:37,870
Hey, another one just disappeared.

797
01:27:46,730 --> 01:27:48,730
Ahh! I thought I had it just now!

798
01:27:55,510 --> 01:27:57,000
Scary!
